DESCRIPTION:The Center for Innovation in Global Health (CIGH) Humanitarian
  Health Series at Stanford University\, convened jointly with the Consorti
 um of Universities for Global Health (CUGH) and the Stanford Center for Af
 rican Studies\, continues its 2026 programming on critical humanitarian an
 d global health crises. This 60-minute international panel brings together
  multidisciplinary experts to examine the escalating risk of food insecuri
 ty and famine in the Sahel and to identify concrete policy pathways for re
 sponse.\n\nEvent URL: https://events.stanford.edu/event/humanitarian-healt
 h-seminar-series\n\nSource: stanford_virtual
