BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:How to Reduce Your Environmental Toxic Exposures and Protect Your 
 Family’s Health
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T200000
DTSTAMP:20260913T061709Z
UID:6d3b55c44630097a@gid-seminars.wnprc.wisc.edu
CATEGORIES:Class/Seminar
DESCRIPTION:Plastics and environmental toxins are everywhere — in our fo
 od packaging\, cookware\, personal care products\, and even our drinking w
 ater. Emerging research links everyday chemical exposures\, including micr
 oplastics\, to hormonal disruption\, inflammation\, metabolic issues\, and
  other serious health concerns. The good news is that small\, informed cha
 nges can meaningfully reduce your exposure and support long-term well-bein
 g.\n\nIn this engaging webinar\, you'll explore the science behind how the
 se toxins enter our bodies and why they matter for your health. We'll focu
 s on what the evidence actually says\, so you can make confident\, practic
 al decisions rather than feeling overwhelmed by alarming headlines.\n\nKey
  takeaways include simple swaps for common household items and personal pr
 oducts\, how to read labels and identify problematic ingredients\, and a p
 rioritized action plan so you know where your efforts will have the greate
 st impact. You'll leave with reference guides to use at home and in the st
 ore.\n\nThis class will be recorded and a one-week link to the recording w
 ill be shared with all registered participants.\n\nThis class qualifies fo
 r double points as part of our August promotion. To receive 4\,000 points
 \, attend at least 80% of the live session or watch the entire recording b
 y 12 pm Pacific Time on August 31. You can still receive 2\,000 points if 
 you watch the recording after August 31 and before the expiration date.\n
 \nRequest disability accommodations and access info.\n\n\n\nClass details 
 are subject to change.\n\nEvent URL: https://events.stanford.edu/event/how
 -to-reduce-your-environmental-toxic-exposures-and-protect-your-familys-hea
 lth\n\nSource: stanford_virtual
LOCATION:Online
URL:https://events.stanford.edu/event/how-to-reduce-your-environmental-tox
 ic-exposures-and-protect-your-familys-health
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Reminder: How to Reduce Your Environmental Toxic Exposures and
  Protect Your Family’s Health
TRIGGER:-PT1H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
